---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import EntryList from '../components/EntryList.astro';
import { getModels } from '../lib/content';
const favs = (await getModels()).slice(0, 4).map((m) => ({ title: m.data.title, href: `/models/${m.id}`, kind: 'Model', note: m.data.oneliner }));
---
<Base title="Start here" description="New here? The best places to begin.">
  <div class="page">
    <h1 class="title">Start here</h1>
    <p>Welcome. I’m KV, and this is my notebook: mental models, essays, books and projects, all following whatever I’m curious about. If you only read a few things, make it these.</p>
    <h2 class="sub-h">Favourites</h2>
    <EntryList rows={favs} />
    <h2 class="sub-h">Then</h2>
    <p class="measure">Browse the rest of the <a href="/models" class="u">models</a>, see what I’m <a href="/books" class="u">reading</a>, or check what I’m doing <a href="/now" class="u">now</a>. The best way to keep up is <a href="/weekly" class="u">Stay Curious</a>, every Sunday.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
